ts=2026-09-12T04:59:42.522Z type=decision scope=fluxora/p5 content="PART 5 WORKSPACE INTELLIGENCE delivered. Backend: electron/ipc/workspaceIndex.ts — indexWorkspace(workspaceId) walks folder (skip node_modules/dist/build/.git/venv etc, max 50k files, depth 14), returns WorkspaceIndex {languages[{lang,count}], fileCount, dirCount, totalSize, git{isRepo,branch,hasChanges,lastCommit}, packageManagers[], dependencies Record<manager,Record<name,version>>, readme(presolved path), readmeSnippet(500 chars), topStructure[📁 dir/ (n), 📄 file], recentFiles[10], indexedAt, durationMs}. Language map ~46 ext (ts→TypeScript, js→JavaScript, py→Python, etc). Pkg detection: package.json(+lock: pnpm/yarn/bun/npm), requirements.txt, pyproject.toml(+uv), Cargo.toml, go.mod, composer.json, Gemfile, mix.exs. Git via .git/HEAD branch read + git status --porcelain + git log -1 --oneline (execFileSync with 3s timeout, safe-catch). Persisted to new workspace_index table (workspace_id PK, data JSON, indexed_at). Migration added to electron/database/index.ts migrations array (after idx_terminal_workspace); getAllTables() includes workspace_index. registered in main.ts (registerWorkspaceIndexIpc) after registerSearchIpc; preload workspace.index(id)+getIndex(id). Store (workspaceStore.ts): indexes:Record, indexing:Record, getIndex(id) fetches cached, indexWorkspace(id) calls IPC w/ concurrency guard, auto-index on selectWorkspace + openFolder + restoreLastWorkspace(getIndex only). UI: src/components/workspace/WorkspaceIntelligence.tsx — stats cards (Files/Folders/Source size/Git state), Git badges (branch, clean/dirty, last commit), package manager badges, language bars w/ counts, dependency chips grouped by manager (top 4 managers, 24 deps ea), README snippet card, structure grid (top 40), recent files list (8). Reindex button. Wired as third tab in WorkspaceView (Brain icon, value='intelligence') after terminal-git, renders <WorkspaceIntelligence workspaceId path/>. RUNTIME-VERIFIED via electron test runners against compiled dist: real chat folder → 126 files/33 dirs/1.3MB/69ms, languages TypeScript72 JS27 MD6 JSON6, npm + 37 deps/16 dev, topStructure correct; git repo → isRepo:true branch:master hasChanges:false lastCommit 'e2475ce init'. Dev DB = C:\\Users\\kavitha\\AppData\\Roaming\\ai-workspace\\data\\aiworkspace.db (NOT Electron folder). workspace_index table confirmed present with cols workspace_id/data/indexed_at. Build+tsc both green; boot smoke 4 procs." tags=part5,workspace,intelligence,indexer,git,dependencies
